{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792651620, "covers_from": "2026-10-22T06:47:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-22T06:48:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792651680, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-22T06:47:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 69035, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北市的公園小黑蚊非常多，帶孩子去公園時很容易叮滿全身，即使擦防蚊液也很難全身而退，希望能有相關處理", "display_name": "南港代表 No.69,035", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T06:47:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44061, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "教育", "content": "敦化國小的圖書館幹事或者是其他這種必須聘雇身心障礙者的職位，真的對小朋友很不友善，也沒有耐心。", "display_name": "松山代表 No.44,061", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T06:47:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 43670, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "食安", "content": "以前營養午餐都是當日烹調完拍照傳給家長，現在一早八點就放當日菜色示意圖，不是都應該放當日烹調的嗎？", "display_name": "松山代表 No.43,670", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T06:47:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36244, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "仁愛路圓環都沒花，要多種樹，學新加坡,。陽明山山上廁所很髒，食物有蒼蠅", "display_name": "大安代表 No.36,244", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 44061, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.44,061", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 43670, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.43,670", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 36244, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.36,244", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 69036, "sprite_key": "turtle_oldtown", "display_nam